      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The author have reviewed 10 cases of calcification of the nucleus pulposus treated operatively. The lesions were situated in the thoracic or lumbar spine and were the cause of severe pain. Operation was done after failure of conservative treatment. The results have been considered to be satisfactory."},
